	"name": "Warmaker’s Reserve",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/consumables/drinks/alcohol-spirits-bottle-green.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>At 15th level, you’ve learned to stash a small reserve of healing on your person. Once per long rest, while you are at 0 HP and dying, you may choose to pull out a flask, vial, crystal or other container and consume your Reserve by drinking it or breaking the reserve. Doing so allows you to immediately expend up to 5 hit dice as if you had taken a short rest at the start of your turn, before you roll your death saving throw. As a bonus action, you may attempt a performance check to appear to be dying or dead, but you can neither move nor take your action on the turn that you use this ability.</p><p>If you have no hit dice available, you instead become stable with 1 HP.</p>",
